// EXPECTED: compile error
// expect-error: static local 'c' is accessed from both interrupt and main code
// BUG-971 (ISR sibling; adopted from loving-davinci-r3an9y BUG-915): a static local in a helper the ISR reaches is shared
// with main code exactly like a global; it had no global-scope Symbol, so the
// ISR check never saw it. (Checker verdict — GCC refuses ISRs on hosted x86.)
void helper() { static u32 c = 0; c += 1; }
interrupt TIM1 { helper(); }
u32 main() { helper(); return 0; }
